$CellContext`y, $CellContext`z])) == 
     0, (Derivative[
        0, 0, 0, 
         2][$CellContext`r][$CellContext`t, $CellContext`x, $CellContext`y, \
$CellContext`z] + 
       Derivative[
        0, 0, 2, 
